MemeFight Party — meme template images

Files in this directory (meme-*.svg) are original meme-FORMAT illustrations
created for MemeFight Party. They evoke familiar meme layouts (two-panel,
three-panel, sign, etc.) using CC0 emoji and simple shapes — not copyrighted
photo memes.

These assets are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 where
applicable. You may use, copy, and modify them without attribution.

https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

Manifest: templates.json (maps files to text overlay boxes in the DB).
